            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Various stabilizing systems and devices are described for holding and maneuvering medical devices. Some systems and devices include one or more of a base plate, a carriage, and a clamp, or a combination thereof. The base plate can be attached to one or more tables. The carriage can be moveably attached to the base plate or can be integrally formed with the base plate. The carriage can receive one or more clamps. The one or more clamps can be moveably attached to the carriage or the base and configured to receive one or more medical devices.</p>
            </abstract>
